    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d456">

                <pb facs="0551" n="463" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg463"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Clayton to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-02-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 5, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2142.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose copy and
                    translation of a note from Mr. Mariscal stating that my note, reiterating my
                    request for prompt action in the case of H. C. Harding and H. E. Dugat,
                    imprisoned at Matamoros, was referred to the treasury department with the
                    renewed request that prompt investigation be made.</p>
                <p>I have etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d456-a1.xml" xpointer="d456-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
